        <mxCell id="cLLlDjUxxVwjTj7rJgLG-3" value="Telematics&amp;nbsp; Unit&lt;div&gt;For POC as board will be stationery or we may run the edge system in laptop for demos , we need capability to simulate truck been driven on a highway , so we need to simulate vechicle statics and GPS&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;" style="shape=note2;boundedLbl=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=25;verticalAlign=top;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="1">
